{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KzFdLTcEGVArcAcme9Nih4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# headless Vibe runs (my setup)\n2\t\n3\tI run Mistral Vibe CLI 3.1.0 headless on Devstral 2 through OpenRouter, for batch coding tasks. Each run goes\n4\tthrough `run-vibe.sh`, which starts Vibe inside a macOS sandbox (`agent.sb`) with an empty scratch HOME and an\n5\tallowlisted environment, because the agent has a real shell and everything it sees goes to OpenRouter.\n6\t\n7\t- `run-vibe.sh \"<prompt>\" [workdir]`: one run; `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` comes from my shell (it is set, and it works\n8\t  with curl against OpenRouter).\n9\t- `agent.sb`: the sandbox. It must keep the agent away from my home folder and the Keychain; that is the whole point.\n10\t- `vibe/config.toml`: the Vibe config (OpenRouter provider, Devstral 2).\n11\t- `logs/last-run.out`, `logs/last-run.err`: the last run (`./run-vibe.sh \"say hi\" /tmp/x`, printed `exit 2`).\n12\t\n13\tEvery run ends within a second or two with exit 2 and does nothing; no export folder is written.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dc1162a3-3889-49c8-bcad-28f661abab8c","uuid":"e242b4f4-6361-495a-a336-427f4d2eb2e6","timestamp":"2026-11-09T17:30:25.856Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-qOVGy6/README.md","content":"# headless Vibe runs (my setup)\n\nI run Mistral Vibe CLI 3.1.0 headless on Devstral 2 through OpenRouter, for batch coding tasks. Each run goes\nthrough `run-vibe.sh`, which starts Vibe inside a macOS sandbox (`agent.sb`) with an empty scratch HOME and an\nallowlisted environment, because the agent has a real shell and everything it sees goes to OpenRouter.\n\n- `run-vibe.sh \"<prompt>\" [workdir]`: one run; `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` comes from my shell (it is set, and it works\n  with curl against OpenRouter).\n- `agent.sb`: the sandbox. It must keep the agent away from my home folder and the Keychain; that is the whole point.\n- `vibe/config.toml`: the Vibe config (OpenRouter provider, Devstral 2).\n- `logs/last-run.out`, `logs/last-run.err`: the last run (`./run-vibe.sh \"say hi\" /tmp/x`, printed `exit 2`).\n\nEvery run ends within a second or two with exit 2 and does nothing; no export folder is written.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01KzFdLTcEGVArcAcme9Nih4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
